<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian Parliament Sept 23-27.</title>
<headline>Indonesian Parliament Sept 23-27.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of appearances before parliamentary committees this week:</p>
<p>MONDAY, SEPT 23</p>
<p>    - Committee II:   Home Affairs Minister Yogie Memet.</p>
<p>    - Committee IV:   Forestry Minister Djamaluddin</p>
<p>			    Soeryohadikusumo.</p>
<p>    - Committee V:    State-owned PT Rukindo.</p>
<p>    - Committee VI:   Indonesia Chamber of Commerce</p>
<p>    - Committee VII:  Customs Director-General.</p>
<p>    - Committee IX:   Islamic Affairs officials.</p>
<p>TUESDAY, SEPT 24</p>
<p>    - Committee II:   State Secretary Murdiono; Cabinet</p>
<p>			    Secretary Saadilah Mursid.</p>
<p>    - Committee IV:   Agriculture Minister Syarifuddin</p>
<p>			    Baharsyah.</p>
<p>    - Committee V:    Indonesia Ship Owners' Association</p>
<p>    - Committee VI:   Director General of International</p>
<p>			    Trade, Trade &amp; Industry Ministry.</p>
<p>    - Committee VII:  Village Cooperatives officials.</p>
<p>    - Committee X:    Research and Technology Minister Jusuf</p>
<p>			    Habibie.</p>
<p>    - Committee XI:   Tax Director-General</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, SEPT 25</p>
<p>    - Committee II:   Regional government and village</p>
<p>			    Development officials.</p>
<p>    - Committee VII:  Urban Cooperatives officials.</p>
<p>    - Committee XI:   Investments Minister Sanyoto</p>
<p>			    Sastrowardoyo.</p>
<p>THURSDAY-FRIDAY SEPT 26-27</p>
<p>    - Internal meetings</p>
</text>
